cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Systematic review corpus: mutation testing for RESTful API security"
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Delgado S."
    given-names: "Carlos A."
    affiliation: "Universidad del Valle"
abstract: >-
  Search queries, per-study screening decisions with supporting evidence, and
  derived aggregate tables for a systematic literature review on mutation
  testing applied to the security evaluation of RESTful APIs, covering the
  publication window 2000 to 2026.
keywords:
  - systematic literature review
  - mutation testing
  - RESTful API security
  - PRISMA 2020
